  - title: The Stapler
    memo: 'FINAL MEMO: Accounting''s secret weapon has woken up on the desk. Dodge
      its staple fans and slams, and hit the glowing mouth when the jaw opens. End
      the Night Shift War.'
    mode: 3
    room: 0
    killTarget: 0
    maxRivals: 0
    timeLimit: 0
